The spell name is "berserk", and it sends all monsters in sight of the
caster berserk.  It is indeed a big bonus to-hit and to-damage, but it's
also a penalty to-brains; they'll start fighting their way through each
other to get to you, regardless of what's in front of them.

It's a binary state for monsters, so they cannot be affected by it more
than once.  But it can create all kinds of havoc, especially in your
particular situation: it normally doesn't affect the caster, but when
you have _two_ casters suddenly both casters are also angry.

Some monsters start out that way, but they should be relatively obvious.

